# The build context is the repository root (for the root bcresnet_audio.*
# registry seed and the device firmware sources). Send only what the
# Dockerfile COPYs.
*
!bcresnet_audio.onnx
!bcresnet_audio.json
!controller/
!device/go.mod
!device/go.sum
!device/cmd/
!device/internal/
!device/pkg/
!device/companion/
# Go tests are not firmware: kept out so they neither rebuild it nor move the
# version based on its source hash. device/companion/test stays in: the companion stage
# runs those tests, and they are part of the app's version.
device/**/*_test.go
device/**/testdata
# Built from device/companion by the companion stage; a stale local copy
# must not reach the image.
device/internal/companion/app.apk
device/internal/companion/app.version
device/internal/companion/ksplugin.zip
controller/tests
controller/data
controller/echomuse.db*
controller/static/dashboard.js
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
